abstract: >-
  This OpenDRIVE dataset models a road network
  excerpt of the city of Brunswick, Lower Saxony,
  Germany. Main application scopes of this OpenDRIVE
  data are in the domain of automated driving:
  simulation, verification and validation. The data
  has been acquired in context of the research
  project ViVre.
